  "remaining_obligations": [
    "Prove actual global vector SourceSubdifferential support restricts to the literal feasible V and represent it as a continuous linear functional.",
    "For an arbitrary source chosen norm, prove finite-dimensional coordinate-functional continuity and transport the support pairing and norm estimates without identifying that norm with an InnerProductSpace instance norm.",
    "For f+indicator(V), prove indicator-zero arithmetic at p,z in V; any converse extension outside V requires properness and EReal arithmetic and is not established here.",
    "Existing theorem_2_23_inclusion supplies vector support only under actual proper-component hypotheses; its continuous-functional consumer is not connected yet.",
    "Full printed Lemma4.2 iff, converse correction and V subset dom(partial f) qualification remain OPEN.",
    "Actual cumulative FTRL/BTRL proper/finite objectives, algorithm minimizers, constrained support and difference-loss support producers remain OPEN.",
    "Qualified attainment/uniqueness (Theorem6.9), dual-norm scalar estimates, telescope/indexing and corrected 7.47/15.31 terminal obligations remain OPEN."
  ],
